<Routines>
<Routine Name="I00_MappedTags" Type="RLL" SafetySignature="72A0116D - 2BD49EB1 - 6D153D14 - 5EBE29C0 - 90E0E67F - E415DA2C - 204CB13D - D23006E9" SafetySignatureTimestamp="12/16/2025, 02:42:09.003 PM">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Input: Safety Mapped Tags]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Standard Tags Mapped to Safety]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MappedSafTags_Sfty.BOOL[0].0)OTE(SafetyReset);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MappedSafTags_Sfty.BOOL[0].1)OTE(GuardLink01_Ch0.UnlkReqSfty);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MappedSafTags_Sfty.BOOL[0].2)OTE(GuardLink01_Ch0.UnlkReqNewSfty);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MappedSafTags_Sfty.BOOL[0].3)OTE(GuardLink01_Ch0.LkReqNewSfty);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="I01_GuardLink" Type="RLL" SafetySignature="1DF92626 - 22123445 - E736E2B3 - 84B0340B - EE256388 - EB209A7D - 5BAEAFA4 - F1F5B0C0" SafetySignatureTimestamp="12/16/2025, 02:42:09.003 PM">
<Description>
<![CDATA[GuardLink]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Hazard Safe is the safety bit required for the safety Unlk Command]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Safe_State)XIC(GuardLink01_Ch0.UnlkReqSfty)XIO(Reset_GuardDoor_Lk)OTE(GuardLink01_Ch0.UnlkCmd);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Lock Sequence:
0 = Initialize
100 = Unlocked    
200 = Lock Cmd   
300 = Lock Cmd/Opn 
400 = Closed/Locked
500 = Unlock Cmd]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[AOI_GuardLinkLock(GuardLink01_Ch0.Unlock,3,1500,GuardLink01:I,GuardLink01:I.Ch0,GuardLink01:O.Ch0,GuardLink01_Ch0.LkReqNewSfty,GuardLink01_Ch0.UnlkCmd,GuardLink01_Ch0.UnlkReqNewSfty);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="L10_Logic" Type="RLL" SafetySignature="A600BE74 - AA18B3F5 - 6D0AED7C - 103603DB - 962336D4 - 07993958 - 30DA6BF2 - A9C57664" SafetySignatureTimestamp="12/16/2025, 02:42:09.003 PM">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Logic: Reset, Input Summary, Run Permissive]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Internal safety logic faults are reset on rising edge.
Request Guard Door lock on reset rising edge. 
Transition Reset: ISO13849-1 stipulates that safety functions reset must occur on signal transition.
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(SafetyReset) [TOF(RestTmr,?,?) ,OSF(ResetSB,ResetOB) ] ,XIC(RestTmr.DN) OTE(Reset_GuardDoor_Lk) ,XIC(ResetOB) OTE(Reset) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Indicate to machine safety requires a reset]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(SafetyIn_Ok)XIO(GuardLink01_Ch0.UnlkReqSfty)XIO(Safe_RunPerm)OTE(SafetyReset_REQD);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Safety Input Summary Rung]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(GuardLink01_Ch0.Unlock.Out_Ch_RunRdy)OTE(SafetyIn_Ok);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Zone Power On Conditions]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Reset) ,XIC(Safe_RunPerm) ]XIC(SafetyIn_Ok)XIO(GuardLink01_Ch0.UnlkReqSfty)XIO(Zn1_CROUT1.FP)OTE(Safe_RunPerm);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Safe State Confirmation
Timer is worst case stop time.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Zn1_CROUT1_Off)[MOVE(3000,StopTmr.PRE) TON(StopTmr,?,?) ,XIC(StopTmr.DN) OTE(Safe_State) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="MainRoutine" Type="RLL" SafetySignature="33DF395D - ED46A470 - A6F391D8 - 5CD66A8A - B67FB482 - 404C489D - D1C6791B - AC770284" SafetySignatureTimestamp="12/16/2025, 02:42:09.003 PM">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(I00_MappedTags,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(I01_GuardLink,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(L10_Logic,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(O20_Contactor,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="O20_Contactor" Type="RLL" SafetySignature="F0227BCA - E6C59DCB - AA497B0F - 5763F00C - 4ED824EA - 63E9DE8A - D612C772 - EC976DEA" SafetySignatureTimestamp="12/16/2025, 02:42:09.003 PM">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Output - Contactors]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Contactor CROUT
Reset output branch allows recovery from a feedback input fault by allowing the solenoids to be cycled independently of the CROUT instruction under input latched fault conditions. The SafetyIn_Ok must be ON for safety.
If the CROUT is off with no fault or diagnostic code, then the contactors are OFF.
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(Local:2:I.Pt00.Status) XIC(Local:2:I.Pt01.Status) OTE(Zn1_CROUT1.OutputStatus) ,CROUT(Zn1_CROUT1,NEGATIVE,500,Safe_RunPerm,Local:1:I.Pt00.Data,Local:1:I.Pt00.Data,Local:1:I.Pt00.Status,Zn1_CROUT1.OutputStatus,ResetSB) raC_Dvc_CROUT(Zn1_CROUT1_Dvc,Zn1_CROUT1,Zn1_CROUT1_Inf,Zn1_CROUT1_Sts) ,[XIC(Zn1_CROUT1.O1) ,XIC(Zn1_CROUT1.FP) XIO(Local:1:I.Pt00.Data) XIC(SafetyIn_Ok) XIC(ResetSB) ] OTE(Local:2:O.Pt00.Data) OTE(Local:2:O.Pt01.Data) ,XIO(Zn1_CROUT1.O1) XIO(Zn1_CROUT1.FP) EQ(Zn1_CROUT1.DiagnosticCode,0) OTE(Zn1_CROUT1_Off) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
<SafetySignaturesHmac Value="04DA29422A924C38A8FBF126762AC48E2B541F9A87EBAFB95B03F6F284908B8201"/>
